Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:11:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vk_texture: with NX2NAVI_TEX_RT_RECYCLE=1 (default 0) a new
 render target in its own memory takes the image and memory of a released one
 of the same description unused for NX2NAVI_TEX_RT_TRIM_AGE submits, instead
 of creating one while the released one waits for a sweep; counted in the mem
 destroys line (#160)

